      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORAINE KOBY (7) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 1.3 lengths back in second (22.18) at Warrnambool in a Free For All over 390m. Expected to feature in the finish again. MEXICAN JACK (4) has a strong record this trip with three wins and three placings from eight starts. Scored by a neck last time (25.37) in a Grade 5 over 450m at Shepparton. Can feature in the finish. RITZA OLD MATE (5) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (25.40) at this track behind Inclination in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Leading chance. CINEMATIC (2) scored a scorching Grade 6 win in 23.05 last time. Can measure up again.",
